00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:42.650
I don't even know if I can make a town.

00:09:42.650 --> 00:09:44.990
- Just try to make a little town.

00:09:44.990 --> 00:09:45.913
- [Jasmine] Okay.

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:51.330
- That's new.
(Katie laughing)

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:53.780
- That's new, thank you.
(Katie laughing)

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:55.650
Well, you know what?

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:56.810
- [Katie] I like that one.

00:09:56.810 --> 00:09:59.710
- 14, take the juice and immediately.

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:02.720
Take the juice, immediately!

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:03.600
'Cause it's hot.

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:04.433
You pour it over.

00:10:04.433 --> 00:10:05.266
So I was right.

00:10:05.266 --> 00:10:06.510
Remember, I guess this earlier?

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:08.020
I made a flying saucer.

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:09.540
- [Katie] It's so cool, I like it.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.180
- I guess I'll just make more of these.

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:13.780
'Cause I'd rather eat that than this.

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:16.160
I'm just gonna do one
more big one like this

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:17.900
and then I will move on to the next step.

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:19.702
It's reminding me of funnel cake,

00:10:19.702 --> 00:10:21.520
this mess I'm making.

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:22.740
- What if it is funnel cake?

00:10:22.740 --> 00:10:26.427
- Maybe then I messed up.
(Katie laughing)

00:10:26.427 --> 00:10:27.870
- I kind of regret pranking you

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:29.650
because you made this a lot harder.

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:31.440
I'm done, that's my last one.

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:36.440
So I think I'm just gonna put
some squigglies on the bottom

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:38.150
for some height.

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:40.910
These can take the residual juices.

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:42.750
Ooh!
- Are those your small towns?

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:44.550
- My small town, big town.

00:10:44.550 --> 00:10:45.690
Yummy!

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:46.560
Oh, the juice.

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:49.350
Okay, my garlic sugar.
(buzzer ringing)

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:50.687
I'm pouring it over.

00:10:50.687 --> 00:10:52.079
- [Katie] Ooh.

00:10:52.079 --> 00:10:54.402
(Katie laughing)

00:10:54.402 --> 00:10:56.100
It looks otherworldly, right?

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:57.820
- Step 15, solved.

00:10:57.820 --> 00:10:58.740
Yeah, it is!
(bell dinging)

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:00.780
Works, yeah it does!
(Katie laughing)

00:11:00.780 --> 00:11:02.720
Enjoys for 30 seconds.

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:06.620
Oh, let it soak for 30 seconds
(bell dinging)

00:11:06.620 --> 00:11:08.170
and then eat.

00:11:08.170 --> 00:11:10.090
I'm finished!

00:11:10.090 --> 00:11:12.370
Ta-da!
- Master.

00:11:12.370 --> 00:11:14.440
- My master squiggly towns.

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:15.920
Bring in the original.

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:17.287
I'm ready to see it.

00:11:17.287 --> 00:11:18.344
"Farm on the Moon."

00:11:18.344 --> 00:11:19.180
(Jasmine sniffing)

00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:21.045
Mine smell like garlic.
(scraping sound)

00:11:21.045 --> 00:11:23.148
(Jasmine sniffing)
- [Katie] Open your eyes!

00:11:23.148 --> 00:11:26.340
(Jasmine laughing)

00:11:26.340 --> 00:11:30.038
- Okay, this has been my biggest fail yet.

00:11:30.038 --> 00:11:32.110
- [Katie] No, no!

00:11:32.110 --> 00:11:33.380
Do you want to know what the name is?

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:34.213
- Yeah!

00:11:34.213 --> 00:11:37.012
- Okay, it's jalebi.
- Oh, jalebi!

00:11:37.012 --> 00:11:38.770
- Yes and it is an Indian dessert.

00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:41.257
- [Jasmine] Let's try
a "Farm on the Moon."

00:11:41.257 --> 00:11:42.380
(crunching sound)

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:43.213
Mm!

00:11:44.170 --> 00:11:46.450
Oh, my God.
- Really?!

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:47.680
- Yeah!

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:49.950
The garlic is amazing.

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:51.300
Phenomenal, I'm not even kidding.

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:52.133
- [Katie] Really?!

00:11:52.133 --> 00:11:54.660
- I'm dead serious.
- Wow!

00:11:54.660 --> 00:11:56.320
- All right, let's try some jalebi.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:58.910
My batter was definitely not thick enough

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:01.180
to make a shape like this.

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:02.440
Was I wrong with the milk?

00:12:02.440 --> 00:12:03.273
- The milk was wrong.

00:12:03.273 --> 00:12:04.344
It was supposed to be yogurt.

00:12:04.344 --> 00:12:06.360
- I knew it!
(crunching sound)

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:10.750
Mm, mm, delicious but different.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:12.810
I'm very impressed with the shape.

00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:14.130
It's just beautiful.

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:15.170
Entrée, dessert.

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:16.070
This was really fun.

00:12:16.070 --> 00:12:18.397
Make sure to keep sending
recipes to Katie on Instagram

00:12:18.397 --> 00:12:21.750
@oldladiekatie and maybe
a little easier next time?

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:24.310
- Maybe, we'll see.
(Katie laughing)

00:12:24.310 --> 00:12:25.300
- Bye, guys!

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:26.133
- Bye!

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:28.769
- [Andrew] Oh, yes!

00:12:28.769 --> 00:12:31.352
(upbeat music)

